Error [E0120]: `hs` was not moved here, so this loop can't take its handles
  --> tests/ui/loop_borrowed_task_list.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     loop h, hs { total += h.join() ?? 0 }
    |             ^^
 Why: each step hands you the handle itself, and a task handle cannot be copied — so the loop takes the whole list with the move-capability marker `^`
 Fix: take the list with the move-capability marker `^`: `hs: ^[Task<Int>]`, or collect the work in a canonical `task.all` or `task.group` block
